    <!-- Nemo's own art - the sidebar and location glyphs, the sort-menu icons,
         the eject icon and the progress ring. Installed as loose files in the
         prefix, which the portable Windows bundle never carries: it stages only
         the GTK stack's own hicolor, so every nemo-* name missed and the status
         bar and location toggle drew image-missing. Riding inside the binary
         answers that everywhere and costs the packed exe no files.

         gtk_icon_theme_add_resource_path treats what it finds as part of
         hicolor, so the aliases flip the on-disk <context>/<size> layout round
         to the <size>/<context> hicolor's index.theme actually names.

         Keep in step with publicIcons in source/data/icons/meson.build. -->
